      <activity id="6a9b7ef2-85e4-55cd-b649-3a38a9b73b35" activityNameId="df036324-0428-51fb-9737-1ba9f7cd4230" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Asbestos, crysotile type, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Asbestos, crysotile type, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of asbestos. Quite a large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
UUID: 99f6d4c9-4106-31ff-8c79-d00dd811dbef
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions.
Location: Data are used here as European average.
Technology: Data approximated with data from lime mining, crushing and milling.
Time period: date of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_99f6d4c9-4106-31ff-8c79-d00dd811dbef.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
